# Unit Test Cases - Movie Recommendation API

## Authentication Module (auth.js)

1. Test login/success returns 200 with user object
2. Test login/failed returns 401 status
3. Test logout clears session and redirects
4. Test google OAuth redirects to correct URL
5. Test google/callback success redirects to client
6. Test google/callback failure redirects to login/failed
7. Test session regeneration functions work

## Trending Routes (trending.js)

1. Test GET /trending returns 200 status
2. Test response contains success: true
3. Test response contains data array
4. Test handles server errors with 500 status
5. Test data structure has required fields

## Upcoming Routes (upcoming.js)

1. Test GET /upcoming returns 200 status
2. Test contains upcoming movie data
3. Test handles errors gracefully

## Recommended Routes (recommended.js)

